        "description": "Enum values for potential hotel amenities\n\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_UNSPECIFIED: Unspecified\n\nDefault value indicating no specific amenity. Should never be used.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_FRONT_DESK_24H_SERVICE: 24-Hour Front Desk\n\nIndicates a front desk available 24/7.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_AIR_CONDITIONING: Air Conditioning\n\nRooms or facilities equipped with air conditioning.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_AIRPORT_SHUTTLE_SERVICE: Airport Shuttle Service\n\nTransportation service to and from the airport.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BABY_SITTING_SERVICE: Babysitting Service\n\nChildcare service provided by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BAR: Bar\n\nOnsite bar available for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BEAUTY_SALON: Beauty Salon\n\nFacilities for beauty treatments and services.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BROADBAND_SERVICE: Broadband Service\n\nHigh-speed internet access for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BUSINESS_CENTER: Business Center\n\nWorkspace with office amenities like computers and printers.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CD_PLAYER: CD Player\n\nIn-room CD player for audio entertainment.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CHILDREN_FACILITY: Children Facility\n\nDesignated area or services for children.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_COFFEE_MAKER: Coffee Maker\n\nIn-room coffee-making machine.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CONCIERGE_SERVICE: Concierge Service\n\nPersonalized assistance for reservations, tours, and more.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CONNECTING_ROOMS_SERVICE: Connecting Rooms\n\nRooms with interconnecting doors.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_COT: Cot\n\nBaby crib or cot available on request.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CURRENCY_EXCHANGE_SERVICE: Currency Exchange Service\n\nFacility to exchange foreign currency.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_DVD_VIDEO_PLAYER: DVD/Video Player\n\nIn-room player for DVDs and videos.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_DISABLED_FACILITY: Disabled Facility\n\nFacilities designed for guests with disabilities.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_DOCTOR_ON_CALL_SERVICE: Doctor On Call\n\nMedical assistance available on request.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_FITNESS_CENTER: Fitness Center\n\nGym facilities available to guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_GYMNASIUM: Gymnasium\n\nDedicated area for fitness and exercise.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_HAIR_DRYER: Hair Dryer\n\nIn-room hair dryer available for use.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_INDOOR_SWIMMING_POOL: Indoor Swimming Pool\n\nIndoor pool facilities available for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_IRONING_SERVICE: Ironing Service\n\nClothes ironing service offered by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_JACUZZI: Jacuzzi\n\nOnsite jacuzzi or hot tub available.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_LAUNDRY: Laundry\n\nLaundry services provided for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_LIFT: Lift\n\nElevator access within the property.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_MASSAGE_SERVICE: Massage Service\n\nMassage therapy offered by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_MEETING_ROOM: Meeting Room\n\nSpace available for business meetings or events.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_MINI_BAR: Mini Bar\n\nIn-room mini refrigerator stocked with drinks and snacks.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_MODEM: Modem\n\nInternet connection through a modem.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_NON_SMOKING_SERVICE: Non-Smoking Service\n\nRooms or areas designated for non-smokers.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_OUTDOOR_SWIMMING_POOL: Outdoor Swimming Pool\n\nOutdoor pool facilities available for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_PARKING: Parking\n\nParking area provided for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_PETS_ALLOWED_SERVICE: Pets Allowed\n\nGuests can bring pets to the property.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_RESTAURANT: Restaurant\n\nOnsite dining facilities for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ROOM_SERVICE: Room Service\n\nFood and beverage delivery to guest rooms.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SAFE_DEPOSIT_BOX: Safe Deposit Box\n\nSecure box for valuables, available in-room or at the front desk.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SATELLITE_TV: Satellite TV\n\nTelevision service offering a variety of channels via satellite.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SAUNA: Sauna\n\nA small room used for dry or wet heat sessions for relaxation and health benefits.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SMOKING_SERVICE: Smoking Service\n\nDesignated areas or services that accommodate smoking guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SOLARIUM: Solarium\n\nA room or facility with sunlamps or a glass enclosure for sunbathing.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TELEVISION: Television\n\nStandard in-room TV for entertainment.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TELEPHONE: Telephone\n\nIn-room phone service for communication.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TENNIS_COURT: Tennis Court\n\nA facility or area where guests can play tennis.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_WAKE_UP_CALL_SERVICE: Wake-Up Call Service\n\nA service where hotel staff call to wake up guests at their requested time.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_WHEEL_CHAIR_ACCESS: Wheelchair Access\n\nAccessible facilities designed for guests with mobility challenges.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_WIFI_SERVICE: Wi-Fi Service\n\nWireless internet service available in rooms or public areas.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BALCONY: Balcony\n\nA private or shared outdoor area attached to the room.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BATHROBE_SERVICE: Bathrobe Service\n\nComplimentary or provided bathrobes for guest comfort.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BATHTUB: Bathtub\n\nA bathtub available in the guestroom bathroom.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CAFE: Café\n\nAn onsite café for drinks and light refreshments.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CASINO: Casino\n\nAn onsite facility offering gambling and gaming entertainment.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BOTTLED_WATER_SERVICE: Bottled Water Service\n\nComplimentary or provided bottled water for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_DAILY_NEWSPAPER_SERVICE: Daily Newspaper Service\n\nNewspapers delivered to rooms or available in common areas.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_DESK: Desk\n\nAn in-room desk for work or leisure activities.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_EXECUTIVE_FLOOR: Executive Floor\n\nExclusive floor or area with enhanced services for business or VIP guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_INTERNET_ACCESS_SERVICE: Internet Access Service\n\nGeneral internet service available for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_KITCHENETTE: Kitchenette\n\nA small in-room kitchen equipped for basic cooking.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_MICROWAVE: Microwave\n\nAn in-room microwave for reheating or light cooking.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_NIGHTCLUB: Nightclub\n\nAn onsite club offering music, dancing, and entertainment.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_RADIO_SERVICE: Radio Service\n\nIn-room radio for entertainment or relaxation.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SECRETARY_SERVICE: Secretary Service\n\nAssistance with administrative tasks, like typing or document handling.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SHOP: Shop\n\nAn onsite store for shopping needs.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SHOWER: Shower\n\nA standard bathroom shower.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_STEAM_ROOM: Steam Room\n\nA room designed for steam-based relaxation and health benefits.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_THEMATIC_TV_SERVICE: Thematic TV Service\n\nSpecialized television programming based on themes or genres.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TOUR_SERVICE: Tour Service\n\nAssistance with organizing local tours and sightseeing activities.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TRANSLATION_SERVICE: Translation Service\n\nServices to assist guests with translation or interpretation needs.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TROUSER_PRESS: Trouser Press\n\nIn-room device for pressing trousers.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_VIDEOGAME_SERVICE: Video Game Service\n\nVideo game consoles or services available for entertainment.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SPA: Spa\n\nOnsite facility offering wellness treatments and relaxation services.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SQUASH_COURT: Squash Court\n\nA facility for playing squash.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BICYCLE_RENTAL_SERVICE: Bicycle Rental Service\n\nOnsite service providing bicycles for rent to explore the area.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_VALET_PARKING_SERVICE: Valet Parking Service\n\nA service where staff park and retrieve guests' vehicles.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ALARM_CLOCK: Alarm Clock\n\nAn in-room alarm clock for waking up on time.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ANIMATION_SERVICE: Animation Service\n\nEntertainment activities, often for children, organized by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BANQUETING_SERVICE: Banqueting Service\n\nFacilities and services for hosting banquets or large events.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BARBEQUE: Barbeque\n\nOutdoor grilling area or service for barbeque meals.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BASKETBALL_COURT: Basketball Court\n\nA facility for playing basketball onsite.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SUN_UMBRELLA: Sun Umbrella\n\nUmbrellas provided for shade, typically by the pool or beach.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BELL_STAFF_SERVICE: Bell Staff Service\n\nStaff available to assist with luggage and other needs.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BICYCLE_STORAGE: Bicycle Storage\n\nSecure storage area for guest bicycles.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BILLIARDS: Billiards\n\nA facility for playing pool or other cue sports.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BINGO: Bingo\n\nOrganized bingo games for entertainment.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BOWLING_ALLEY: Bowling Alley\n\nAn onsite facility for bowling games.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BREAKFAST_ROOM: Breakfast Room\n\nA designated area for serving breakfast.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BREAKFAST_TO_GO: Breakfast To-Go\n\nPre-packed breakfast for guests on the move.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BUTLER_SERVICE: Butler Service\n\nPersonalized service for handling guest needs and requests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CAR_RENTAL: Car Rental\n\nOnsite or partner service for renting vehicles.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CASH_MACHINE: Cash Machine\n\nAn ATM available onsite for cash withdrawals.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CHAPEL: Chapel\n\nA small onsite place of worship.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CONFERENCE_FACILITY: Conference Facility\n\nRooms and equipment for hosting business meetings or conferences.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CONGRESS_FACILITY: Congress Facility\n\nLarge-scale event space for conventions or congresses.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_DINING_ROOM: Dining Room\n\nAn onsite area designated for meals.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_DIVING_SERVICE: Diving Service\n\nEquipment rental and arrangements for scuba diving activities.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_DOORMAN_SERVICE: Doorman Service\n\nStaff at the entrance to greet and assist guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_DVD_VIDEO_LIBRARY_SERVICE: DVD/Video Library Service\n\nA collection of DVDs or videos available for guest use.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_EARLY_CHECKIN_SERVICE: Early Check-In Service\n\nOption to check in before the standard time.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ENTERTAINMENT_ROOMS: Entertainment Rooms\n\nDedicated rooms for games, movies, or other entertainment.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_EXPRESS_CHECKIN_SERVICE: Express Check-In Service\n\nFaster check-in process for convenience.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_EXPRESS_CHECKOUT_SERVICE: Express Checkout Service\n\nA quick checkout process to save time.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_EXTRA_BED: Extra Bed\n\nAdditional bed provided upon request.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_FAX: Fax\n\nOnsite fax services for communication or document transmission.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_FIREPLACE: Fireplace\n\nA cozy fireplace available in the room or common areas.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_GAME_ROOM: Game Room\n\nA room equipped with games and entertainment.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_GARDEN: Garden\n\nLandscaped outdoor space for relaxation or walks.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_HAIRDRESSERS: Hairdressers\n\nAn onsite salon for hair care and styling services.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_HEATING: Heating\n\nHeating system available for guest comfort.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_HORSE_RIDING_SERVICE: Horse Riding Service\n\nArrangements or facilities for horse riding.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_JACUZZI_BATHTUB: Jacuzzi Bathtub\n\nIn-room or onsite Jacuzzi for relaxation.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_KITCHEN: Kitchen\n\nFully equipped kitchen available for guest use.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_LATE_CHECKOUT_SERVICE: Late Checkout Service\n\nOption to check out after the standard time.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_LIBRARY: Library\n\nOnsite collection of books for guest use.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_LIMOUSINE_SERVICE: Limousine Service\n\nLuxury transport service provided by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_LOUNGE: Lounge\n\nComfortable common area for relaxation.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_LUGGAGE_STORAGE: Luggage Storage\n\nSecure storage for guest luggage.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_MARINA: Marina\n\nDocking facility for boats and yachts.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_MEDICAL_SERVICE: Medical Service\n\nOnsite or partner medical assistance available for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_MINIGOLF: Minigolf\n\nA mini-golf course for leisure activities.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_MULTILINGUAL_STAFF_SERVICE: Multilingual Staff Service\n\nStaff available who speak multiple languages.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_NURSERY: Nursery\n\nChildcare or nursery services for guests with children.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_PADEL_TENNIS: Padel Tennis\n\nFacilities for playing padel tennis.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_PHARMACY: Pharmacy\n\nOnsite or nearby pharmacy for medical needs.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_PHOTOCOPIER: Photocopier\n\nOnsite copier for documents.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_PLAYGROUND: Playground\n\nOutdoor or indoor area with play equipment for children.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_POOL_BAR: Pool Bar\n\nA bar located near the pool area, offering drinks and refreshments.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_PRIVATE_BEACH: Private Beach\n\nExclusive beach access provided for hotel guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_READING_AREA: Reading Area\n\nA quiet space designated for reading and relaxation.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_RECEPTION_AREA: Reception Area\n\nThe main area for guest check-ins, check-outs, and inquiries.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SAILING_SERVICE: Sailing Service\n\nServices or rentals for sailing activities provided by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SECURITY_SERVICE: Security Service\n\nOn-site security personnel or systems for guest safety.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SHOE_POLISHING_SERVICE: Shoe Polishing Service\n\nA service offered to polish or clean guests' shoes.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SHUTTLE_SERVICE: Shuttle Service\n\nTransportation service for guests between the hotel and nearby locations.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SKI_SHUTTLE_SERVICE: Ski Shuttle Service\n\nA shuttle service specifically for transporting guests to ski areas.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SKI_STORAGE: Ski Storage\n\nStorage facilities for ski equipment provided by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SMOKING_AREA: Smoking Area\n\nA designated area for smoking within the hotel premises.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_STATION_SHUTTLE_SERVICE: Station Shuttle Service\n\nTransportation service connecting the hotel to nearby stations.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SUPERMARKET: Supermarket\n\nA small convenience store or supermarket available within or near the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TABLE_TENNIS: Table Tennis\n\nFacilities for guests to play table tennis.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TICKET_OFFICE: Ticket Office\n\nAn on-site facility for purchasing tickets for tours or local attractions.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TOURIST_INFORMATION_OFFICE: Tourist Information Office\n\nA service providing information about local attractions and activities.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TURKISH_BATH: Turkish Bath\n\nA traditional steam bath service offered by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_UV_SUNBEDS: UV Sunbeds\n\nTanning beds equipped with UV lights for guest use.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_VOICE_MAIL_SERVICE: Voice Mail Service\n\nA feature allowing guests to receive and access voice messages.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_WATER_SPORTS_SERVICE: Water Sports Service\n\nActivities or rentals for water sports provided by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_WEDDING_FACILITY: Wedding Facility\n\nDedicated facilities for hosting weddings and related events.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ROOM_WITH_A_VIEW: Room with a View\n\nA room offering scenic views.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ROOM_WITH_A_SEA_VIEW: Room with a Sea View\n\nA room featuring a view of the sea.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ROOM_WITH_A_LAKE_VIEW: Room with a Lake View\n\nA room featuring a view of a lake.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ROOM_WITH_A_MOUNTAIN_VIEW: Room with a Mountain View\n\nA room featuring a view of the mountains.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_DECK_LOUNGER: Deck Lounger\n\nA comfortable lounger available for guests to relax on decks or pool areas.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_INDOOR_PARKING: Indoor Parking\n\nCovered parking facilities provided within the hotel premises.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_OUTDOOR_PARKING: Outdoor Parking\n\nUncovered parking spaces available for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CHILDREN_POOL: Children's Pool\n\nA shallow pool designed specifically for children.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_POOL: Pool\n\nA general swimming pool available for guest use.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ROOM_JACUZZI: Room Jacuzzi\n\nPrivate jacuzzi available in guest rooms.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ROOM_POOL: Room Pool\n\nPrivate pool provided within guest rooms.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_GOLF_AMENITY: Golf Amenity\n\nFacilities or services for playing golf.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_HOT_SPRING: Hot Spring\n\nNatural hot spring baths offered by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_PRIVATE_HOT_SPRING_BATH: Private Hot Spring Bath\n\nExclusive hot spring bath access for individual guests or groups.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_OUTDOOR_HOT_SPRING_BATH: Outdoor Hot Spring Bath\n\nHot spring baths located outdoors for guest relaxation.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_RUNNING_NATURAL_HOT_SPRING_BATH: Running Natural Hot Spring Bath\n\nContinuously flowing natural hot spring baths.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_NONSMOKING_FLOOR: Nonsmoking Floor\n\nEntire floors designated as nonsmoking areas.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_NO_ELEVATOR: No Elevator\n\nIndicates the hotel does not have elevator facilities.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_WIFI_IN_DESIGNATED_AREAS: WiFi in Designated Areas\n\nInternet connectivity available only in specific areas of the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_FREE_WIFI_IN_DESIGNATED_AREAS: Free WiFi in Designated Areas\n\nComplimentary internet access provided in specific areas of the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_LOBBY_BAR: Lobby Bar\n\nA bar located in the hotel lobby for refreshments and beverages.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_FIRST_AID_ROOM: First Aid Room\n\nA facility equipped to provide basic medical assistance to guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ATM: ATM\n\nAn automated teller machine available on the hotel premises.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CHINESE_RESTAURANT: Chinese Restaurant\n\nOn-site dining offering authentic Chinese cuisine.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TEAHOUSE: Teahouse\n\nA designated area or facility for enjoying various types of tea.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_WESTERN_RESTAURANT: Western Restaurant\n\nOn-site dining offering a variety of Western dishes.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_EXECUTIVE_LOUNGE: Executive Lounge\n\nA premium lounge with exclusive services for executive-level guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_KARAOKE: Karaoke\n\nFacilities for karaoke entertainment.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_CHESS_ROOM: Chess Room\n\nA designated area for playing chess and other board games.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SUNBATHING_AREA: Sunbathing Area\n\nOutdoor spaces designated for sunbathing.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SNORKELING: Snorkeling\n\nEquipment or services for snorkeling activities provided by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TOILET_WITH_ARM_SUPPORT: Toilet with Arm Support\n\nToilets equipped with arm support for accessibility.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SHOWER_SEAT: Shower Seat\n\nSeats provided in showers for convenience and accessibility.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_LOW_SINK: Low Sink\n\nBathroom sinks installed at a lower height for accessibility.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BATH_WITH_ARM_SUPPORT: Bath with Arm Support\n\nBathtubs equipped with arm supports for safety and convenience.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BATHROOM_EMERGENCY_CALL_BUTTON: Bathroom Emergency Call Button\n\nEmergency call buttons installed in bathrooms for guest safety.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ELECTRIC_VEHICLE_CHARGING_STATION: Electric Vehicle Charging Station\n\nCharging facilities for electric vehicles provided by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ACCESSIBLE_PARKING: Accessible Parking\n\nParking spaces specifically designed for guests with disabilities.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ACCESSIBLE_ROOMS_AVAILABLE: Accessible Rooms Available\n\nRooms equipped for guests with disabilities.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ASSISTIVE_LISTENING_DEVICES_AVAILABLE: Assistive Listening Devices Available\n\nHearing assistance devices available for guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_AUDITORY_GUIDANCE: Auditory Guidance\n\nAudio-based navigation assistance provided by the hotel.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BATHROOM_EMERGENCY_PULL_CORD: Bathroom Emergency Pull Cord\n\nEmergency pull cords installed in bathrooms for guest safety.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BATH_SEAT: Bath Seat\n\nRemovable or fixed seats available for use in bathtubs.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BATH_WITH_GRAB_BAR: Bath with Grab Bar\n\nBathtubs equipped with grab bars for safety.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_BRAILLE_OR_TACTILE_SIGNAGE: Braille or Tactile Signage\n\nSignage with braille or tactile features for visually impaired guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_HANDRAILS_IN_STAIRWAYS: Handrails in Stairways\n\nStairways equipped with handrails for safety and accessibility.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_LOWERED_BATHROOM_SINK: Lowered Bathroom Sink\n\nBathroom sinks installed at a lower height for wheelchair accessibility.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_PHONE_ACCESSIBILITY_AVAILABLE: Phone Accessibility Available\n\nPhones equipped with features for guests with disabilities.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_RAISED_TOILET: Raised Toilet\n\nToilets installed at a raised height for accessibility.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_ROLL_IN_SHOWER: Roll-In Shower\n\nShowers designed for wheelchair access.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SHOWER_WITH_GRAB_BAR: Shower with Grab Bar\n\nShowers equipped with grab bars for safety and convenience.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_SIGN_LANGUAGE_CAPABLE_STAFF: Sign Language Capable Staff\n\nStaff members trained in sign language for guest communication.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TOILET_WITH_GRAB_BAR: Toilet with Grab Bar\n\nToilets equipped with grab bars for accessibility.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_TRANSFER_SHOWER: Transfer Shower\n\nShowers equipped with features for easy transfers for guests with mobility challenges.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_VISUAL_ALARMS: Visual Alarms\n\nVisual alert systems for fire or emergencies, suitable for hearing-impaired guests.\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_WATER_SLIDE: Water Slide\n\nWater slide, waterpark or aqua park\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_FIRST_AID_KIT: First aid kit\n\nFirst aid provisions on site\n - HOTEL_AMENITY_FIRE_EXTINGUISHERS: Fire Extinguisher\n\nFire extinguisher to be available on site",
        "title": "Hotel Amenity"
      },
      "v1HotelGuestType": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "GUEST_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
          "GUEST_TYPE_FAMILY",
          "GUEST_TYPE_BUSINESS",
          "GUEST_TYPE_COUPLE",
          "GUEST_TYPE_SOLO",
          "GUEST_TYPE_GROUP",
          "GUEST_TYPE_OTHER"
        ],
        "default": "GUEST_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
        "description": "Enum values for different type of guests\n\n - GUEST_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED: Unspecified\n\nDefault value. Shouldn't be returned\n - GUEST_TYPE_FAMILY: Family\n\nGuest type is family\n - GUEST_TYPE_BUSINESS: Business\n\nGuest type is business\n - GUEST_TYPE_COUPLE: Couple\n\nGuest type is a couple\n - GUEST_TYPE_SOLO: Solo\n\nGuest type is solo\n - GUEST_TYPE_GROUP: Group\n\nGuest type is a group\n - GUEST_TYPE_OTHER: Other\n\nGuest type is other",
        "title": "Hotel Guest Type"
      },
      "v1HotelGuestTypeFilter": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "values": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/v1HotelGuestType"
            },
            "description": "Guest types to filter by",
            "title": "Values"
          }
        },
        "description": "Message containing a hotel-guest-type-based filter",
        "title": "Hotel Guest Type Filter"
      },
      "v1HotelImage": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique identifier for the image",
            "title": "Id"
          },
          "type": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1ImageType",
            "description": "Type of the image",
            "title": "Image type"
          },
          "thumbnailUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "URL of the thumbnail version of the image",
            "title": "Thumbnail"
          },
          "galleryUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "URL of the gallery version of the image",
            "title": "Gallery"
          },
          "fullUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "URL of the full-size version of the image",
            "title": "Full image"
          },
          "dynamicUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "URL of a dynamically generated version of the image",
            "title": "Dynamic image"
          }
        },
        "description": "Represents an image associated with a hotel",
        "title": "Hotel Image"
      },
      "v1HotelInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "hotelId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ID of the hotel",
            "title": "Hotel ID"
          },
          "distanceFromTarget": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1Distance",
            "description": "Distance from the searched target destination",
            "title": "Distance"
          },
          "deeplink": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Deeplink for an in-funnel search for this hotel",
            "title": "Deeplink"
          }
        },
        "description": "Information about the hotel in relation to the search request",
        "title": "Hotel Info"
      },
      "v1HotelPricingOption": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ID of the pricing option",
            "title": "ID"
          },
          "agentId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ID of the agent providing the offer",
            "title": "Agent Id"
          },
          "hotelId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ID of the hotel associated with the offer",
            "title": "Hotel ID"
          },
          "roomName": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name of the room",
            "title": "Room Name"
          },
          "roomType": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1RoomType",
            "description": "Type of the room",
            "title": "Room Type"
          },
          "cancellationPolicy": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1CancellationPolicyType",
            "description": "Information of the cancellation policy for the specific pricing option",
            "title": "Cancellation Policy"
          },
          "mealPlan": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1MealPlanType",
            "description": "Meal plan information for the specific pricing option",
            "title": "Meal plan"
          },
          "price": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1OfferPrice",
            "description": "Price with any discounts applied",
            "title": "Price"
          },
          "priceWithoutDiscount": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1OfferPrice",
            "description": "The original price before any discounts were applied.\nThis field will be empty if there is no discount on this offer.\nNote: When populated, the taxes_and_fees breakdown will be empty, as this\nobject's purpose is to show the discount amount rather than provide a full price breakdown.",
            "title": "Price without discount"
          },
          "deeplink": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Deeplink to the booking page of the agent for the specific pricing option",
            "title": "Deeplink"
          },
          "paymentType": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1PaymentType",
            "description": "Payment policy for the booking",
            "title": "Payment Type"
          }
        },
        "description": "A message containing pricing option information for the specific hotel",
        "title": "Hotel Pricing Option"
      },
      "v1HotelsServicePollSearchBody": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "sort": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1Sort",
            "description": "Sorting to be applied to the hotels that offers are returned for.\nIf sort is not specified then the default value is SORT_ORDER_TYPE_BEST and SORT_ORDER_DIRECTION_DESCENDING",
            "title": "Sort"
          },
          "pagination": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1PaginationOptions",
            "description": "Specifies the pagination for retrieving hotel offers.\nThe `limit` field in PaginationOptions must not exceed 50.\n`offset` must be >= 0.\n\nExample:\n  limit: 25, offset: 50 → retrieves offers for hotel 51 to hotel 75",
            "title": "Pagination"
          },
          "filters": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "$ref": "#/definitions/hotelslivev1HotelsFilter"
            },
            "description": "Filters to be applied on the query.\nAny filter added will discard any offers that don't satisfy the specific filter conditions.",
            "title": "Filters"
          }
        },
        "title": "The request body for Hotels Poll Search Request method"
      },
      "v1ImageType": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "IMAGE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
          "IMAGE_TYPE_OUTLOOK",
          "IMAGE_TYPE_BEDROOM",
          "IMAGE_TYPE_INTERIOR",
          "IMAGE_TYPE_BATHROOM",
          "IMAGE_TYPE_OTHERS",
          "IMAGE_TYPE_BEACH",
          "IMAGE_TYPE_LOBBY",
          "IMAGE_TYPE_POOL",
          "IMAGE_TYPE_MEETING_ROOM",
          "IMAGE_TYPE_RESTAURANT_BAR",
          "IMAGE_TYPE_GYM"
        ],
        "default": "IMAGE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
        "description": "Enumerates the different types of hotel images\n\n - IMAGE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED: Image type is unspecified\n - IMAGE_TYPE_OUTLOOK: Image of the hotel's outlook or exterior\n - IMAGE_TYPE_BEDROOM: Image of a bedroom\n - IMAGE_TYPE_INTERIOR: Image of the hotel's interior\n - IMAGE_TYPE_BATHROOM: Image of a bathroom\n - IMAGE_TYPE_OTHERS: Image of other areas or aspects of the hotel\n - IMAGE_TYPE_BEACH: Image of a nearby beach\n - IMAGE_TYPE_LOBBY: Image of the hotel lobby\n - IMAGE_TYPE_POOL: Image of the hotel pool\n - IMAGE_TYPE_MEETING_ROOM: Image of a meeting room\n - IMAGE_TYPE_RESTAURANT_BAR: Image of the hotel restaurant or bar\n - IMAGE_TYPE_GYM: Image of the hotel gym",
        "title": "Image type"
      },
      "v1MealPlanFilter": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "values": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/v1MealPlanType"
            },
            "description": "Meal plan types to filter by",
            "title": "Values"
          }
        },
        "description": "Message containing a meal-plan-based filter",
        "title": "Meal PLan Filter"
      },
      "v1MealPlanType": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
          "MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_ALL_INCLUSIVE",
          "MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_BREAKFAST_INCLUDED",
          "MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_FULL_BOARD",
          "MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_HALF_BOARD",
          "MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_ROOM_ONLY"
        ],
        "default": "MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
        "description": "Enum values for meal plan types\n\n - MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED: Unspecified\n\nDefault value when not specified\n - MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_ALL_INCLUSIVE: All inclusive\n\nMeal plan is all inclusive\n - MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_BREAKFAST_INCLUDED: Breakfast included\n\nMeal plan is only breakfast included\n - MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_FULL_BOARD: Full board\n\nMeal plan is full board\n - MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_HALF_BOARD: Half board\n\nMeal plan is half board\n - MEAL_PLAN_TYPE_ROOM_ONLY: Room only\n\nNo meals are included",
        "title": "Meal plan type"
      },
      "v1OfferPrice": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "currency": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The currency of the offer price",
            "title": "Currency"
          },
          "price": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "double",
            "description": "The price of the offer that should be displayed to the traveller.\nThis is NOT always the final price that a traveller would have to pay during checkout.\nDifferent markets have different rules for what a display price should be.\nFor example for some specific markets, the taxes or fees\nwill not typically be included in the display price.",
            "title": "Price"
          },
          "basePrice": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "double",
            "description": "The price of the offer excluding fees",
            "title": "Base Price"
          },
          "taxesAndFees": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "$ref": "#/definitions/v1TaxAndFee"
            },
            "description": "The detailed breakdown of taxes and fees applied to this price.\nNote: This breakdown is only populated when this OfferPrice represents the final\ndisplayed price. For price_without_discount objects, this field will be empty as\nthe purpose is to show the discount amount, not provide a full price breakdown.",
            "title": "Taxes and Fees"
          }
        },
        "description": "Object to represent price of the offer",
        "title": "Offer Price"
      },
      "v1PaginationOptions": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "offset": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "description": "The number of items to skip before starting to collect the result set.\n\nThis is typically calculated as:\n    offset = (page_number - 1) * limit\n\nFor example:\n  - Page 1 with limit 15 → offset = (1 - 1) * 15 = 0\n  - Page 2 with limit 15 → offset = (2 - 1) * 15 = 15\n\nMust be a non-negative integer.",
            "title": "Offset"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "description": "The number of items to return in the current page of results.\nMust be a positive integer.\nSpecific APIs may impose stricter maximum limits—see API-specific docs.",
            "title": "Limit"
          }
        },
        "description": "A message specifying pagination parameters used across APIs.\nThis message allows clients to request a specific subset of results\nby defining how many items to skip and how many to return.",
        "title": "Pagination Options"
      },
      "v1PaymentType": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "PAYMENT_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
          "PAYMENT_TYPE_PREPAID",
          "PAYMENT_TYPE_PAY_ON_ARRIVAL"
        ],
        "default": "PAYMENT_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
        "description": "Enum values for payment type for hotel offers\n\n - PAYMENT_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED: Payment Type Unspecified\n\nNo payment type is specified\n - PAYMENT_TYPE_PREPAID: Prepaid\n\nPayment type is prepaid.\nPayment has to be made on time of booking.\n - PAYMENT_TYPE_PAY_ON_ARRIVAL: Pay on arrival\n\nPayment type is pay on arrival.\nPayment has to be with the hotel on arrival.",
        "title": "Payment Type"
      },
      "v1PaymentTypeFilter": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "values": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/v1PaymentType"
            },
            "description": "Payment types to filter by",
            "title": "Values"
          }
        },
        "description": "Message containing a payment-type-based filter",
        "title": "Payment Type Filter"
      },
      "v1PriceRangeFilter": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "minValue": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "double",
            "description": "Min value of the range (inclusive)",
            "title": "Min value"
          },
          "maxValue": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "double",
            "description": "Max value of the range (inclusive)\nUnspecified represents \"unlimited\"",
            "title": "Max value"
          }
        },
        "description": "Message containing a price-range-based filter",
        "title": "Price Range Filter"
      },
      "v1RoomType": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "ROOM_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
          "ROOM_TYPE_GENERIC_ROOM",
          "ROOM_TYPE_SINGLE_ROOM",
          "ROOM_TYPE_DOUBLE_ROOM",
          "ROOM_TYPE_TRIPLE_ROOM",
          "ROOM_TYPE_SHARED_ROOM",
          "ROOM_TYPE_FAMILY_ROOM",
          "ROOM_TYPE_SUITE_ROOM",
          "ROOM_TYPE_JAPANESE_STYLE_ROOM",
          "ROOM_TYPE_JAPANESE_BED_ROOM",
          "ROOM_TYPE_TWIN_ROOM"
        ],
        "default": "ROOM_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
        "description": "Represents different types of rooms available for booking.\n\n - ROOM_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED: Unspecified Room Type\n\nRoom type is unspecified.\n - ROOM_TYPE_GENERIC_ROOM: Generic Room\n\nRoom type is generic.\n - ROOM_TYPE_SINGLE_ROOM: Single Room\n\nRoom type is single.\n - ROOM_TYPE_DOUBLE_ROOM: Double Room\n\nRoom type is double.\n - ROOM_TYPE_TRIPLE_ROOM: Triple Room\n\nRoom type is triple.\n - ROOM_TYPE_SHARED_ROOM: Shared Room\n\nRoom type is shared.\n - ROOM_TYPE_FAMILY_ROOM: Family Room\n\nRoom type is family.\n - ROOM_TYPE_SUITE_ROOM: Suite Room\n\nRoom type is suite.\n - ROOM_TYPE_JAPANESE_STYLE_ROOM: Japanese Style Room\n\nRoom type is Japanese-style.\n - ROOM_TYPE_JAPANESE_BED_ROOM: Japanese Bed Room\n\nRoom type is Japanese-style with beds.\n - ROOM_TYPE_TWIN_ROOM: Twin Room\n\nRoom type is twin.",
        "title": "Room Type"
      },
      "v1Sort": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/hotelslivev1SortOrderType",
            "description": "Type of sorting to be applied to the results.\nDefault value is SORT_ORDER_TYPE_BEST",
            "title": "Type"
          },
          "order": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1SortOrderDirection",
            "description": "Direction of the sorting to be applied.\nDefault value is SORT_ORDER_DIRECTION_DESCENDING",
            "title": "Order"
          }
        },
        "description": "Message to specify sorting type and order",
        "title": "Sort"
      },
      "v1SortItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "itemId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ID of one of the response items.",
            "title": "Item ID"
          },
          "value": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "description": "Value of the score for this item.",
            "title": "Value"
          }
        },
        "title": "Score object"
      },
      "v1SortOptions": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "hotel": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1SortOrder",
            "description": "The sorting that was applied from the request to the hotels in the response.",
            "title": "Hotel"
          },
          "pricingOption": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1SortOrder",
            "description": "The sorting that was applied to the pricing options in the response.\nThis will always be sorted by SORT_ORDER_TYPE_BEST & SORT_ORDER_DIRECTION_DESCENDING.\nSORT_ORDER_TYPE_BEST will be ordered by price in this scenario.",
            "title": "Pricing Option"
          }
        },
        "title": "Sort options object"
      },
      "v1SortOrder": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/hotelslivev1SortOrderType",
            "description": "The type of sorting that was applied.",
            "title": "Type"
          },
          "direction": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1SortOrderDirection",
            "description": "The direction of the sorting that was applied.",
            "title": "Direction"
          },
          "sortItems": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "$ref": "#/definitions/v1SortItem"
            },
            "description": "Scores related to the sorting type and direction.\nEach item returned in the response will be given a score based on the sort applied.",
            "title": "Sort Items"
          }
        },
        "title": "Sort order object"
      },
      "v1SortOrderDirection": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "SORT_ORDER_DIRECTION_UNSPECIFIED",
          "SORT_ORDER_DIRECTION_ASCENDING",
          "SORT_ORDER_DIRECTION_DESCENDING"
        ],
        "default": "SORT_ORDER_DIRECTION_UNSPECIFIED",
        "description": "- SORT_ORDER_DIRECTION_UNSPECIFIED: Default value when not specified\n - SORT_ORDER_DIRECTION_ASCENDING: Ascending sorting order\n - SORT_ORDER_DIRECTION_DESCENDING: Descending sorting order",
        "title": "Sorting order direction"
      },
      "v1Stars": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "STARS_UNSPECIFIED",
          "STARS_NO_STAR",
          "STARS_ONE_STAR",
          "STARS_TWO_STAR",
          "STARS_THREE_STAR",
          "STARS_FOUR_STAR",
          "STARS_FIVE_STAR"
        ],
        "default": "STARS_UNSPECIFIED",
        "description": "An enum representing the number of stars\n\n - STARS_UNSPECIFIED: Unspecified\n\nDefault value when not specified\n - STARS_NO_STAR: No Star\n\nHotel has no star rating.\n - STARS_ONE_STAR: One Star\n\nHotel has a 1-star rating.\n - STARS_TWO_STAR: Two Stars\n\nHotel has a 2-star rating.\n - STARS_THREE_STAR: Three Stars\n\nHotel has a 3-star rating.\n - STARS_FOUR_STAR: Four Stars\n\nHotel has a 4-star rating.\n - STARS_FIVE_STAR: Five Stars\n\nHotel has a 5-star rating.",
        "title": "Stars"
      },
      "v1StarsFilter": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "values": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/v1Stars"
            },
            "description": "A collection of Stars enum values to filter by.",
            "title": "Values"
          }
        },
        "description": "Message containing a stars-rating-based filter",
        "title": "Stars Filter"
      },
      "v1TaxAndFee": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "feeType": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1TaxAndFeeType",
            "description": "The type of fee or tax",
            "title": "Tax and Fee Type"
          },
          "value": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "double",
            "description": "The monetary value of the fee",
            "title": "Value"
          },
          "payType": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/v1PaymentType",
            "description": "The type of payment that needs to be made - usually on hotel arrival or on booking time",
            "title": "Payment Type"
          }
        },
        "description": "The taxes and fees applied to the price",
        "title": "Taxes and Fees"
      },
      "v1TaxAndFeeType": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
          "TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_VAT",
          "TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_OTHER",
          "TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_CITY",
          "TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_SERVICE",
          "TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_RESORT",
          "TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_DESTINATION",
          "TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_PAYMENT"
        ],
        "default": "TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
        "description": "Specifies the type of tax or fee applied to the price.\n\n - TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED: Unspecified\n\nThe type is not specified.\n - TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_VAT: Value-Added Tax (VAT)\n\nA general consumption tax.\n - TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_OTHER: Other Fees\n\nAny additional fees.\n - TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_CITY: City Tax\n\nA tax imposed by a city.\n - TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_SERVICE: Service Fee\n\nA charge for services.\n - TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_RESORT: Resort Fee\n\nA mandatory resort charge.\n - TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_DESTINATION: Destination Fee\n\nA fee for staying in a specific area.\n - TAX_AND_FEE_TYPE_PAYMENT: Payment Fee\n\nA charge for payment processing.",
        "title": "Tax and Fee Type"
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "ApiKey": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "x-api-key"
      }
    }
  },
